Hi, I haven't yet had the privelige to sample 3.1, but today just managed to
ascend for the first time ever (no restores).  Anyways, I had this idea on
how to make combat messages a bit more interesting (an idea from mudding).
It would be to add detail on the hit message based upon how much damage
you do per hit to a monster's hp (and vice-versa).  For example, it is now:

  The mumakil hits!  The mumakil misses. --more--
  You hit.  --more--
  The mumakil hits!  The mumakil hits! --more--
  You die... --more--

My idea would be to change it to:

  The mumakil hits hard!  The mumakil misses.  --more--
  You barely hit.  --more--
  The mumakil hits very hard!  The mumakil massacres you!  --more--
  You die... --more--

It would make combats seem more intersting, and it would be easier to tell
apporx how much damage you do with certain weapons, etc.  Anyone got
an opinion on this? Ideas? (flames sent to /dev/null :)

I haven't yet seen 3.1 combat, so maybe I'm way outta line.


